  "title": "Answer: the phenomenal self and the first-person perspective",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "6dc933f7-6151-42ee-b7fa-048946a424ec",
      "text": "The phenomenal self and the first-person perspective are emergent: a phenomenal self emerges when a transparent self-model is added to a system that already has conscious experience, and with the self-world border that a coherent self-model introduces, objectivity emerges together with subjectivity.",
